                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very creepy. First mommy scared me so much I had to put down the HMD.\nIt's a bit repetitive. But the Egyptian flair get's transfered very well. Sometimes a bit too dark. But you have a torch. Seems obvious that it is dark within the pyramids. \nPuzzles start easy and get a bit more demanding later.\nBest Pyramid simulator we have at the moment.\nRecommended on sale and in a bundle.\n\n[i] Twitch Channel : https://www.twitch.tv/mrorange55\nYoutube Channel : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1UE5TPoF0HX0HVpF_E4uPQ/videos?view_as=subscriber [/i]",
